<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Oil up on news of oil strike.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Oil up on news of oil strike.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd rose in Wednesday morning trade, supported by the firm's announcement on Tuesday that an oil affiliate had succeeded in finding oil reserves in Papua New Guinea which could yield up to 2,000 barrels-per-day.</p>
<p>The share price was up 15 yen at 863 yen at 0035 GMT. Volume was 364,000 shares.</p>
</text>
